Before public distribution, the authorised rights holder must confirm the licence for ReactEnzDB-authored code and the scope of that grant. Third-party code, templates, libraries and assets retain their own licences and notices; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. This notice does not revoke any rights already granted by upstream licensors.

The scientific data, model weights, rules and graph resources are separate materials and are not relicensed by this code package.
